*units tape feet
*units compass clino grads
*case toupper
*truncate 1
*calibrate tape 2 2
*calibrate compass clino 3 2
*flags duplicate surface splay
*infer equates on
*infer plumbs on
*infer exports on
*sd tape 8 metres
*sd compass clino 30 degrees
*declination 30 degrees
*include control-include.svx
0 xx 10 100 0
*units default
